<title>USA: Hawthorne Financial stake cut by investor.</title>
<headline>Hawthorne Financial stake cut by investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor Vernon Herbst said Monday he reduced his stake in Hawthorne Financial Corp to 3.0 percent or 78,323 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Herbst, who resides in Hawthorne, Calif., said he sold 85,000 shares of Hawthorne Financial between November 22 and 25 at $8.00 a share.</p>
<p>Herbst did not specify any reasons in the filing for the transactions. Hawthorne Financial is based in El Segundo, Calif.</p>
</text>
